# With imperfect couplers the bar port no longer goes dark: its minimum is (t1 t2 - k1 k2)^2 = 0.04, 13.98 dB below its maximum.
# The cross port still reaches zero.

title Mach-Zehnder with 40/60 couplers
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.5 1.6 8001

comp c1 coupler kappa=0.4
comp c2 coupler kappa=0.4
comp a waveguide length=100.0
comp b waveguide length=200.0
link c1.3 a.1
link c1.4 b.1
port in c1.1
port in2 c1.2
port bar c2.3
port cross c2.4
link a.2 c2.1
link b.2 c2.2

expect lossless
expect extinction bar 13.9794 0.01
expect deeper cross -40
expect max cross -0.17729 1e-3
